# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:30
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_26c8bd29:

    # gg "Man, I haven't gone go-karting in a LONG time!"
    gg "Cavolo, è da un SACCO di tempo che non vado al kartodromo!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:31
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_425c7596:

    # gg "I'm looking forward to this."
    gg "Non vedo l’ora."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:32
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_c3947180:

    # "While we wait for our turn to drive, we have some time to chat."
    "Mentre aspettiamo il nostro turno per guidare, abbiamo un po’ di tempo per chiacchierare."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:40
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_dba2e530:

    # "Finally, it's our turn."
    "Finalmente, è il nostro turno."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:46
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_8f9b8839:

    # "We line up and get ready to take off."
    "Ci mettiamo in fila e ci prepariamo a partire."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:48
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_18ef0fb8:

    # gg "Hope you're ready to eat my dust."
    gg "Spero che tu sia pronto a mangiare la mia polvere."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:49
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_53dbc1f5:

    # pc "Yeah right. You're going down."
    pc "Sì, come no. Ti farò a pezzi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:50
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_800a9087:

    # gg "No, you!"
    gg "No, tu!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:57
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_26aa19ac:

    # "When the light comes on and the buzzer sounds, she pulls in front very quickly. My kart is not accelerating as fast as hers, no matter how much I mash on the gas."
    "Quando si accende la luce e suona il cicalino, lei mi supera in un attimo. Il mio kart non accelera veloce come il suo, per quanto io prema a fondo sull’acceleratore."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:64
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_1ec15e0c:

    # "As much as I try to catch up, she's just too fast. She takes the corners perfectly, barely letting off the accelerator."
    "Per quanto cerchi di raggiungerla, è semplicemente troppo veloce. Affronta le curve alla perfezione, senza quasi mai togliere il piede dall’acceleratore."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:70
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_d3f8613e:

    # "By the end of our time, she is well in the lead, leaving me far behind."
    "Alla fine del nostro tempo, è nettamente in testa, lasciandomi molto indietro."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:77
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_855b783c:

    # "But once I'm able to get the kart up to top speed, I start catching up with her."
    "Ma una volta che riesco a portare il kart alla velocità massima, comincio a recuperare terreno su di lei."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:83
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_349acc4b:

    # "Then, on the final lap, I'm barely able to slip past her just before we cross the finish line."
    "Poi, all’ultimo giro, riesco a superarla di un soffio proprio prima di tagliare il traguardo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:87
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_96accbe9:

    # gg "That was fun!"
    gg "Che divertimento!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:89
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_3f94ba4d:

    # pc "Yeah it was. You kicked my ass."
    pc "Sì, lo è stato. Mi hai fatto il culo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:90
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_1a12d8de:

    # gg "Lots of Mario Kart practice."
    gg "Un sacco di pratica con Mario Kart."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:92
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_45c6ecca:

    # gg "I can't believe you caught up to me!"
    gg "Non riesco a credere che tu mi abbia raggiunto!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:93
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_778b032e:

    # gg "You're a damn good driver!"
    gg "Sei una pilota davvero brava!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:94
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_c6880d17:

    # pc "Thanks!"
    pc "Grazie!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adriangokartdate.rpy:97
translate italian adriangokartstartdate_9f35c8f5:

    # "When we're ready, I drive her home and walk her up to her front door."
    "Quando siamo pronti, la accompagno a casa e la accompagno fino alla porta d’ingresso."

